msgid "We unite veterinarians, shelters and compassionate people for the happiness of every animal"
msgstr "Har bir hayvonning baxtliligi uchun veterinarlar, boshpanalar va mehr-shafqatli odamlarni birlashtiramiz"

msgid "Join us"
