# ---- Voices of Compassion quotes ----
msgid "\"The question is not, Can they reason? nor, Can they talk? but, Can they suffer?\""
msgstr "«Savol shunda emas: ular fikr yurита oladimi? yoki gapira oladimi? — balki: ular azob cheka oladimi?»"

msgid "\"Our task must be to free ourselves by widening our circle of compassion to embrace all living creatures and the whole of nature and its beauty.\""
msgstr "«Bizning vazifamiz — barcha jonzotlarni va tabiatni o'z mehr doiramizga kiritib, o'zimizni ozod etishdir.»"

msgid "\"The time will come when men such as I will look upon the murder of animals as they now look upon the murder of men.\""
msgstr "«Mening singari odamlar hayvonlarni o'ldirishga hozir odamlarni o'ldirishga qaragandek qaraydigan vaqt keladi.»"

msgid "\"Humanity's true moral test consists of its attitude towards those who are at its mercy: animals.\""
msgstr "«Insoniyatning haqiqiy axloqiy sinovi uning o'z qo'l ostidagilarga — hayvonlarga munosabatida namoyon bo'ladi.»"

msgid "\"Until we extend our circle of compassion to all living things, humanity will not find peace.\""
msgstr "«Biz mehr doiramizni barcha tirik mavjudotlarga kengaytirmagunimizcha, insoniyat tinchlik topa olmaydi.»"

msgid "\"Life is as dear to a mute creature as it is to man. Just as one wants happiness and fears pain, just as one wants to live and not die, so do other creatures.\""
msgstr "«Hayot tilik qila olmaydigan jonzot uchun ham inson uchun kabi azizdir. Xuddi inson baxt tilab, azobdan qo'rqqani kabi, boshqa jonzotlar ham shunday.»"

msgid "\"If having a soul means being able to feel love and loyalty and gratitude, then animals are better off than a lot of humans.\""
msgstr "«Agar ruh borligini his qilish muhabbat, sadoqat va minnatdorlik demak bo'lsa, hayvonlar ko'p odamlardan ustundir.»"

msgid "\"You cannot share your life with a dog or a cat and not know perfectly well that animals have personalities and minds and feelings.\""
msgstr "«It yoki mushuk bilan hayot kechirib, hayvonlarning shaxsiyati, aql-idrok va his-tuyg'ulari borligini bilmaslik mumkin emas.»"

msgid "\"The love for all living creatures is the most noble attribute of man.\""
msgstr "«Barcha tirik mavjudotlarga muhabbat — insonning eng olijanob fazilatidir.»"

msgid "\"It takes nothing away from a human to be kind to an animal.\""
msgstr "«Hayvonga mehribon bo'lish insondan hech narsani olmaydi.»"

msgid "\"If you pick up a starving dog and make him prosperous, he will not bite you. This is the principal difference between a dog and man.\""
msgstr "«Agar och itni olib, uni to'ydirsangiz, u sizni tishlamaydi. Mana bu it bilan insonning asosiy farqi.»"

msgid "\"We can judge the heart of a man by his treatment of animals.\""
msgstr "«Insonning yuragini uning hayvonlarga munosabatiga qarab baholaymiz.»"

msgid "\"Dogs are not our whole life, but they make our lives whole.\""
msgstr "«Itlar bizning butun hayotimiz emas, lekin ular hayotimizni to'liq qiladi.»"

msgid "\"Animals can communicate quite well. And they do. And generally speaking, they are ignored.\""
msgstr "«Hayvonlar juda yaxshi muloqot qila oladi. Va ular muloqot qiladi. Umuman olganda, ular e'tibordan chetda qoladi.»"

msgid "\"We must fight against the spirit of unconscious cruelty with which we treat the animals. True humanity does not allow us to impose such sufferings on them.\""
msgstr "«Biz hayvonlarga nisbatan ongsiz shafqatsizlik ruhiga qarshi kurashishimiz kerak. Haqiqiy insonparvarlik ularga bunday azob berish imkonini bermaydi.»"
